    "title": "Laptops for DENR Region VII, 2024",
    "description": "A complete contracting process: tender (with one amendment) → award → contract → implementation. The flagship example — exercises every station of the journey and produces both clean and flagged indicators.",
    "shape": "full-lifecycle",
    "fictional": true,
    "shapeNote": "Only ~10% of real PhilGEPS processes reach the award+contract stage (per ocds/sample/compiled_releases.jsonl). This example represents that minority.",
